{"id": "salvation-army-food-audit-restatements", "title": "Two corrected audits added $8 million in federal food and changed what auditors tested", "seconds": 48.1, "voice": "tinyvoca:M2", "narrator": "Temporary local narration", "made": "2026-11-28", "key": "4925637bc546118c", "words": 140, "beats": [{"scene": "p", "kind": "hook", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "A food program appeared much smaller in the original audit than in the corrected books.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 4.37, "shot": "s0", "visual": {"type": "hook", "words": ["Federal", "food", "reporting"], "sub": "An award cluster below the audit cutoff"}}, {"scene": "p", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "For 2022 the original federal schedule reported $242,039.", "t0": 4.49, "t1": 9.84, "shot": "s1", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$242,039", "label": "An award cluster below the audit cutoff"}}, {"scene": "p", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "The corrected food program total exceeded four million dollars.", "t0": 9.96, "t1": 13.32, "shot": "s2", "visual": {"type": "record", "source": "changed", "layout": "table", "heading": "FY2022 food program", "context": "Golden State Division", "rows": [{"label": "Original", "value": "$242,039"}, {"label": "Restated", "value": "$4,221,001"}]}}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "The 2023 food program also went from under half a million to more than four million.", "t0": 13.54, "t1": 18.14, "shot": "s3", "visual": {"type": "record", "source": "y23", "layout": "table", "heading": "FY2023 food program", "context": "Golden State Division", "rows": [{"label": "Original", "value": "$433,575"}, {"label": "Restated", "value": "$4,454,620"}]}}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "The two increases together were $8,000,007.", "t0": 18.26, "t1": 21.08, "shot": "s4", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$8,000,007", "label": "The following year required a second correction"}}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "The changes brought the food program into the major-program audit.", "t0": 21.2, "t1": 24.36, "shot": "s5", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "changed", "kicker": "The following year required a second correction", "text": "Audit coverage", "mark": "Audit"}}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "Five San Francisco distribution sites can be identified in both schedules.", "t0": 24.48, "t1": 28.66, "shot": "s6", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "local22", "kicker": "Five San Francisco sites in the schedule", "text": "Local distribution sites", "mark": "Local"}}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "Those sites accounted for $176,583 of food in 2022.", "t0": 28.78, "t1": 34.49, "shot": "s7", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$176,583", "label": "Five San Francisco sites in the schedule"}}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "Their 2023 total was $155,700.", "t0": 34.61, "t1": 38.89, "shot": "s8", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$155,700", "label": "Five San Francisco sites in the schedule"}}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "The revised filings were accepted in April 2026.", "t0": 39.11, "t1": 42.31, "shot": "s9", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "base", "kicker": "Revised filings and subsequent testing", "text": "Revised filings", "mark": "Revised"}}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "The division reported no change in net assets.", "t0": 42.43, "t1": 44.86, "shot": "s10", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "base", "kicker": "Revised filings and subsequent testing", "text": "Net assets", "mark": "Net"}}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "end", "re